# Jemm Design System

Source: Figma file `uix82R4uZUIMq63NlR8zk4` — Jemm UI Library (WIP)

---

## Color tokens (CSS variables)

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| `--neon` | `#00d58c` | Brand accent — buttons, active states, icons, highlights |
| `--ink` | `#121212` | Darkest background / base layer |
| `--lite` | `#f2f2f2` | Primary text / "Lite Gray" |
| `--gray-2` | `#404040` | Borders, dividers, inactive toggles |
| `--charcoal` | `#202020` | Card / surface layer on top of ink |
| `--muted` | `#b4b4b4` | Secondary / caption text |
| `--white` | `#ffffff` | High-contrast text on photos/media |
| `--rose` | `#ff7999` | Destructive / error states |

Never use raw hex values — always reference the CSS variable.

---

## Typography

- **Font**: `Inter` (already loaded via `--font`)
- **Headings**: `font-weight: 600`, `letter-spacing: -0.02em`
- **Body**: `font-weight: 400`, `font-size: 16px`
- **Caption**: `font-size: 13–14px`
- **Sentence case only** — never ALL CAPS labels

---

## Button hierarchy (4 levels — Figma exact)

```css
/* Primary — neon fill, ink text, full pill */
.btn--primary  { background: var(--neon); color: var(--on-accent); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); }

/* Secondary — charcoal fill, white text, full pill */
.btn--secondary { background: var(--pill); color: var(--white); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); }

/* Tertiary / Ghost — transparent, neon border + text, full pill */
.btn--tertiary, .btn--ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--neon); border: 1px solid var(--neon); }

/* Link — no bg, neon text */
.btn--link { background: transparent; color: var(--neon); border: none; }
```

